,"creatorId":"vndb:s789","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s789","name":"澄田 まりや","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24928","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32169","characterName":"三倉 甚兵衛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["12618"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32169"},"originalCharacterName":"三倉 甚兵衛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Masayuki's grandfather who used to be a womanizer when he was younger. Loves challenges, and used to be a full-time gambler through which he made the Mikura family a wealthy one."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c32169"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主人公の祖父】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"政幸の祖父。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"腰は曲がりきり、杖をついて歩くヨボヨボの爺さんだが、それは世を忍ぶ仮の姿で、実際は背筋の伸びた快活なご老人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヨボヨボしている理由は「だって、女の子に優しくされたいし。」という呆れた理由。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無類の女好きだったが、今は亡き祖母の躾で、お触りしようとすると恐怖がよみがえるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常にチャレンジャーであり、そのチャレンジ精神は息子である政幸の父に影響を与え、専業デイトレーダーからギャンブラーへと転身し、莫大な稼ぎを三倉家にもたらした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今、政幸の父は夫婦揃ってカジノのある海外を渡り歩きながら稼いでおり、様々なカジノから恐れられた存在となっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12618","sourceWorkId":"13619","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bda8b2ca4a43a50a0b7d247438d46b57f4e37ffc17fa070fa49f8af41a08fab5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eed221638479c246f4dc3a16ef0dd67e1777aa719cf7fb43c2d2094392fd794b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中澤 アユム","creatorId":"vndb:s1490","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1490","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1490","name